        </h1>
        <p style="font-size:1.08rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.82);margin-bottom:28px;line-height:1.65;">
          All Dent PDR at <strong style="color:#fff;">7695 Granger Rd, Cleveland, OH 44125</strong> specializes in paintless hail damage restoration â€” no repainting, factory finish preserved, full insurance billing handled for you.
        </p>

        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:13px;margin-bottom:32px;">
          {[
            'Free in-person inspection &amp; itemized estimate â€” same day',
            'Direct billing with State Farm, Progressive, Allstate &amp; more',
            'OEM factory paint preserved â€” no sanding, no repainting',
