      <div><strong style="display:block;font-size:1.5rem;color:#fc1317;">Insurance</strong><span style="font-size:0.83rem;color:#6b5c52;">Direct Billing</span></div>
      <div><strong style="display:block;font-size:1.5rem;color:#fc1317;">Same-Week</strong><span style="font-size:0.83rem;color:#6b5c52;">Scheduling Available</span></div>
