        {[
          { q: 'My 2021 RAV4 had dents all over the hood and roof after a hailstorm. All Dent PDR had it looking brand new in two days. They handled everything with my insurance â€” I didn\'t have to do a thing.', a: 'Sarah M.', loc: 'Parma, OH' },
