          { q: 'Does my insurance cover hail damage in Cleveland?', a: 'Most comprehensive auto policies cover hail damage after your deductible. We work directly with State Farm, Progressive, Allstate, and most major carriers to handle the paperwork for you.' },
          { q: 'How long does hail damage repair take?', a: 'Light hail repairs are often completed same-day or next day. Heavy storm damage with multiple panels typically takes 1â€“3 days, depending on dent count and insurance approval.' },
